      "cooked": "<p>Hi all!</p>\n<p>I have customized dropdown menu in Desk in app/navbar-settings</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/2/f288ef909657e4f4f73f8f0d3d1935e4af92b331.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/f288ef909657e4f4f73f8f0d3d1935e4af92b331\" title=\"Снимок экрана 2026-01-20 в 12.20.04\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/2/f288ef909657e4f4f73f8f0d3d1935e4af92b331_2_690x301.png\" alt=\"Снимок экрана 2026-01-20 в 12.20.04\" data-base62-sha1=\"yByVKtUA9YwzMgfyU9fEcBxJhAJ\" width=\"690\" height=\"301\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/2/f288ef909657e4f4f73f8f0d3d1935e4af92b331_2_690x301.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/2/f288ef909657e4f4f73f8f0d3d1935e4af92b331_2_1035x451.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/2/f288ef909657e4f4f73f8f0d3d1935e4af92b331_2_1380x602.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBF9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Снимок экрана 2026-01-20 в 12.20.04</span><span class=\"informations\">2572×1122 150 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>But in website it looks different:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/0/000063161c0ebbc088bb1b5a6d3ebe68aa37461e.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/000063161c0ebbc088bb1b5a6d3ebe68aa37461e\" title=\"Снимок экрана 2026-01-20 в 12.20.10\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/0/000063161c0ebbc088bb1b5a6d3ebe68aa37461e.png\" alt=\"Снимок экрана 2026-01-20 в 12.20.10\" data-base62-sha1=\"PpGO4iKke1cbztYA61tebqzk\" width=\"654\" height=\"434\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Снимок экрана 2026-01-20 в 12.20.10</span><span class=\"informations\">654×434 28.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>How can I customize my dropdown menu in website?</p>\n<p>my Frappe Framework is v15.86.0</p>",
